{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は、個別握手会＊\n来てくださった皆さん、\n来れずとも応援して下さった皆さん、\n有難う御座いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです( *^_^* )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短い時間で、言葉だけでは伝えきれない\n思いがあって、感謝とか全部...\n伝えきれなかったかも。ごめんね。\nでも、大好きなの。\n手、ギュってしてくれて有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外は寒かったけど、人のあったかさを\nすごく感じたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の髪型は、ツインテールで\n巻いてみました！特別です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかなあ？○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、実は ツインテールは\n今日で 見納めっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドシングルからは、髪型\n変えていくよー(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててください  ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな訳で、名古屋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う御座いました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日面接の方頑張れ！\n就活の方応援してます！\n今日お誕生日の方おめでとう！\n遠くから来てくれた方気を付けて帰ってね！\n花粉症の人一緒に頑張ろうっ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sayunyanヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/24/9865281/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}